#
# Firing fixture for the diagnostic root-cause / cluster meta-fold. A witness DAG
# where two findings (F2, F3) derive directly from a shared childless root (F1),
# and a third (F4) derives from F1 transitively through F2:
#
#     F4 --antecedent--> F2 --antecedent--> F1   (F1 is childless: the root)
#                        F3 --antecedent--> F1
#
# The meta-rules (loaded from slices/grounding/logic/module.ttl) must derive, over
# this world-scoped EDB: gmeow:findingTraces closing the DAG, gmeow:findingRootCause
# on F2/F3/F4 all pointing at F1, the gmeow:findingCluster grouping keyed by F1,
# gmeow:clusterRoot F1 on the cluster node, and (extensibility rule) F1 typed
# gmeow:RootFinding. Consumed ONLY by the native meta-findings conformance lane
# (crates/conformance/tests/diagnostics_meta_findings.rs), which re-worlds every
# triple into a named-graph WORLD the chase reads. Lives under tests/ so the global
# make validate gate never loads it as data.
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/diagnostics/tests/> .

ex:rcF1 a gmeow:Finding .
ex:rcF2 a gmeow:Finding ; gmeow:findingAntecedent ex:rcF1 .
ex:rcF3 a gmeow:Finding ; gmeow:findingAntecedent ex:rcF1 .
ex:rcF4 a gmeow:Finding ; gmeow:findingAntecedent ex:rcF2 .
